TEXT 48 1008 Left 2 !.meas tran vin_on FIND V(vin) AT=t_on
TEXT 48 1040 Left 2 !.meas tran t_90 WHEN V(vout)=5.87 RISE=1
TEXT 48 1072 Left 2 !.meas tran vout_max MAX V(vout)
TEXT 48 1104 Left 2 !.meas tran il_max MAX I(L1)
TEXT 48 1136 Left 2 !.meas tran vout_avg AVG V(vout) FROM 8m TO 9m
TEXT 48 1168 Left 2 !.meas tran vout_pp PP V(vout) FROM 8.5m TO 9m
TEXT 48 1200 Left 2 !.meas tran il_pp PP I(L1) FROM 8.5m TO 9m
TEXT 48 1232 Left 2 !.meas tran pin AVG V(vin)*I(Rh) FROM 8m TO 9m
TEXT 48 1264 Left 2 !.meas tran pout AVG V(vout)*V(vout)/6.5 FROM 8m TO 9m
